Package: MMEFM
Type: Package
Title: Multilevel Main Effects Matrix Factor Model Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Kaixin", family = "Liu",
    email = "k.liu31@lse.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for estimation, rank selection, global common-factor
    detection, and simulation for the Multilevel Main Effects Matrix Factor
    Model. This development version contains the package infrastructure;
    statistical methods are not yet implemented.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kx-liu/MMEFM
